WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.853
Require npm test and a separate read-only review.
Actual dark UI, sampled at 2 fps; waits shortened.

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:21.111
Request strict invoice validation.
Local GPT-OSS 20B writes; Qwen3-Coder 30B reviews.

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:35.345
Follow the Lead in the Agent graph.
Selected waits play at 12×; other waits are cut.

00:00:35.345 --> 00:00:44.645
The host runs npm test, then the required reviewer.
The first review approves.

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:52.192
Approval missed a regression: non-finite prices
were no longer rejected.

00:00:52.192 --> 00:01:09.058
Independent inspection catches it.
Send a second request to restore the guard.

00:01:09.058 --> 00:01:14.770
The Lead works on the corrective request.
Repeated waits are omitted.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:23.952
Inspect the final code: the finite-price guard is back.
Independent artifact checks pass.

00:01:23.952 --> 00:01:30.474
The final required review approves.
Host checks pass on the final files.

00:01:30.474 --> 00:01:38.611
Two requests, including a missed regression.
This prepared task is not the historical benchmark.
